{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01DXjWpVNrk9Up6cvYE6YsbP","type":"tool_result","content":"1\tnarrative_guidance: 'Reframe为\"cautionary tale + diagnostic tool\"。核心论点从clean 4-class\n2\t  taxonomy 退守到两个不可动摇的极端：pixel-shuffle catastrophic collapse（数据铁证） 和 pure linear projection\n3\t  immunity（π0 offline数据）。中间类（MLP graded、 threshold-graded）承认pruning method confound，降级为\"suggestive\n4\t  evidence\"。 论文重心转向：(1) 首次发现pixel-shuffle对任何pruning都catastrophic—— 这一发现alone就值一篇paper（4篇concurrent\n5\t  work全忽略了pixel-shuffle VLA）； (2) CV诊断作为practitioner zero-cost工具（不依赖跨模型公平比较）； (3)\n6\t  VTR作为pixel-shuffle专用修复。标题改为\"Token Pruning Catastrophically Fails on Pixel-Shuffle\n7\t  VLAs: Diagnosis and Recovery\"——收窄scope但claims 更bulletproof。仍冲CoRL，不降级venue。\n8\t\n9\t  '\n10\timagined_experiments:\n11\t- name: OpenVLA L2-norm pruning k=0.95\n12\t  plan_id: d108_unified_pruning_protocol\n13\t  description: OpenVLA L2-norm importance-based pruning at k=0.95 (keep 95%), 500\n14\t    episodes LIBERO-Object. 与random k=0.95 (69.4%) 对比。\n15\t  expected_results:\n16\t    overall_sr: 52.0\n17\t    ci_95_lower: 47.7\n18\t    ci_95_upper: 56.3\n19\t    n_episodes: 500\n20\t    random_k095_reference_sr: 69.4\n21\t    delta_vs_random_pp: -17.4\n22\t  result_rationale: 'L2 norm在MLP projector上系统性劣于random。3-layer MLP (GELU)的非线性混合 使L2\n23\t    norm与task relevance解耦：GELU激活压缩后，low-norm token可能携带经过 非线性变换的关键spatial feature（幅度小但信息密度高），而high-norm\n24\t    token可能 被MLP放大但携带冗余信息。Random pruning保留信息的均匀采样，L2 norm则系统性 移除task-critical但low-magnitude的token。即使仅移除5%（约13个token），\n25\t    L2 norm选中的13个恰好rich in action-relevant info，导致17pp drop。 这暴露了跨模型比较的根本confound——OpenVLA用random测到69.4%，\n26\t    X-VLA用L2 norm测到99.0%，但方法差异贡献了约17pp。\n27\t\n28\t    '\n29\t  tables: []\n30\t  figures_description: []\n31\t  analysis: '仅移除5% token即出现17pp gap，证实confound是系统性的而非个别k值偶然。\n32\t\n33\t    '\n34\t- name: OpenVLA L2-norm pruning k=0.9\n35\t  plan_id: d108_unified_pruning_protocol\n36\t  description: OpenVLA L2-norm pruning at k=0.9 (keep 90%), 500 episodes LIBERO-Object\n37\t  expected_results:\n38\t    overall_sr: 44.0\n39\t    ci_95_lower: 39.7\n40\t    ci_95_upper: 48.4\n41\t    n_episodes: 500\n42\t    random_k09_reference_sr: 62.0\n43\t    delta_vs_random_pp: -18.0\n44\t  result_rationale: '移除10%时gap扩大到18pp。L2 norm移除的26个token中包含更多action-critical 信息。MLP\n45\t    projector的GELU非线性使得norm分布与gradient-based importance 呈弱负相关——plan_009_token_importance已证实spearman仅0.407，意味着\n46\t    L2 norm是一个misleading proxy。Random在期望值上保留每个importance quartile 的equal representation，而L2\n47\t    norm over-prune低norm quartile（恰好是 gradient-important的那部分）。18pp gap在500 episode\n48\t    Wilson CI下 高度显著（各自CI约±4pp，不重叠）。\n49\t\n50\t    '\n51\t  tables:\n52\t  - name: 'Table D108: OpenVLA Pruning Method Comparison (Full Sweep)'\n53\t    columns:\n54\t    - k\n55\t    - random_SR\n56\t    - l2norm_SR\n57\t    - delta_pp\n58\t    - confound_significant\n59\t    rows:\n60\t    - - 0.95\n61\t      - 69.4\n62\t      - 52.0\n63\t      - -17.4\n64\t      - yes (>15pp)\n65\t    - - 0.9\n66\t      - 62.0\n67\t      - 44.0\n68\t      - -18.0\n69\t      - yes (>15pp)\n70\t    - - 0.7\n71\t      - 49.0\n72\t      - 31.0\n73\t      - -18.0\n74\t      - yes (>15pp)\n75\t    - - 0.5\n76\t      - 37.4\n77\t      - 21.0\n78\t      - -16.4\n79\t      - yes (>15pp)\n80\t    - - 0.3\n81\t      - 20.6\n82\t      - 7.0\n83\t      - -13.6\n84\t      - marginal\n85\t  figures_description:\n86\t  - '双线对比图：OpenVLA random (blue) vs L2-norm (red) degradation curves, x=k ratio, y=SR%。两条线之间shaded\n87\t    area标注\"pruning method confound\"。 Gap在k=0.7-0.95最宽（17-18pp），k=0.3处因floor effect收窄至~14pp。\n88\t    右侧annotation box: \"Cross-model comparison between OpenVLA-random and X-VLA-L2norm\n89\t    curves is confounded by ~17pp method effect.\"\n90\t\n91\t    '\n92\t  analysis: 'L2 norm全面劣于random（平均约17pp），暴露了核心confound：现有OpenVLA degradation curve用random测得，X-VLA\n93\t    curve用L2 norm测得。X-VLA k=0.9 的97.6%如果换用random可能更高（或保持），但OpenVLA k=0.9的62%如果换用 L2\n94\t    norm仅44%。两条curve之间的gap部分来自pruning method，非纯connector差异。 Taxonomy的MLP-graded与threshold-graded的separation不再clean——\n95\t    论文必须承认中间两类的比较被method confound污染，只保留极端类 （pixel-shuffle catastrophic, pure linear\n96\t    immune）作为iron-clad claims。\n97\t\n98\t    '\n99\t- name: OpenVLA L2-norm pruning k=0.7\n100\t  plan_id: d108_unified_pruning_protocol\n101\t  description: OpenVLA L2-norm pruning at k=0.7, 500 episodes LIBERO-Object\n102\t  expected_results:\n103\t    overall_sr: 31.0\n104\t    ci_95_lower: 27.1\n105\t    ci_95_upper: 35.2\n106\t    random_k07_reference_sr: 49.0\n107\t    delta_vs_random_pp: -18.0\n108\t  result_rationale: 'k=0.7区间gap与k=0.9持平（~18pp）。移除30%时，L2 norm系统性地清除了 low-norm quartile的全部token，而这些token恰好是MLP非线性变换后的\n109\t    compressed representation of spatial information。此时L2 norm的31% 接近X-VLA random\n110\t    k=0.5的预期表现，进一步模糊了\"MLP graded vs threshold-graded\"的边界。\n111\t\n112\t    '\n113\t  tables: []\n114\t  figures_description: []\n115\t  analysis: 18pp gap持续存在，k=0.7是关键比较点因为X-VLA在此处cliff。\n116\t- name: OpenVLA L2-norm pruning k=0.5\n117\t  plan_id: d108_unified_pruning_protocol\n118\t  description: OpenVLA L2-norm pruning at k=0.5, 500 episodes LIBERO-Object\n119\t  expected_results:\n120\t    overall_sr: 21.0\n121\t    ci_95_lower: 17.6\n122\t    ci_95_upper: 24.8\n123\t    random_k05_reference_sr: 37.4\n124\t    delta_vs_random_pp: -16.4\n125\t  result_rationale: '移除50%时gap略收窄至16pp，因为两种方法都已接近severe degradation区间。 但21% vs 37.4%仍是显著差异（CI不重叠）。Floor\n126\t    compression使极端差异 在绝对值上缩小但在相对值上保持——L2 norm的21%是random 37.4%的56%。\n127\t\n128\t    '\n129\t  tables: []\n130\t  figures_description: []\n131\t  analysis: Gap保持>15pp，confound across全部中间k值。\n132\t- name: OpenVLA L2-norm pruning k=0.3\n133\t  plan_id: d108_unified_pruning_protocol\n134\t  description: OpenVLA L2-norm pruning at k=0.3, 500 episodes LIBERO-Object\n135\t  expected_results:\n136\t    overall_sr: 7.0\n137\t    ci_95_lower: 5.0\n138\t    ci_95_upper: 9.7\n139\t    random_k03_reference_sr: 20.6\n140\t    delta_vs_random_pp: -13.6\n141\t  result_rationale: '保留仅30% token时两种方法都严重退化。L2 norm的7%接近collapse—— 保留的77个token中，L2\n142\t    norm选择的top-30%恰好偏向high-magnitude但 low-information的token。Gap收窄至14pp因为random也已接近failure\n143\t    zone。 Floor effect：当base rate低于20%时，能损失的空间本身有限。\n144\t\n145\t    '\n146\t  tables: []\n147\t  figures_description: []\n148\t  analysis: Floor effect使gap收窄，但方向一致——L2 norm在MLP projector上是inferior metric。\n149\t- name: X-VLA L2-norm pruning k=0.7 seed44\n150\t  plan_id: d108_unified_pruning_protocol\n151\t  description: X-VLA k=0.7 pruning with eval seed44, 500 episodes LIBERO-Object。原始seed42结果56.2%。测试cliff\n152\t    pattern跨seed稳健性。\n153\t  expected_results:\n154\t    overall_sr: 28.0\n155\t    ci_95_lower: 24.2\n156\t    ci_95_upper: 32.1\n157\t    n_episodes: 500\n158\t    original_seed42_sr: 56.2\n159\t    delta_vs_seed42_pp: -28.2\n160\t    per_task_sr_sketch:\n161\t      task_0_alphabet_soup: 30\n162\t      task_1_cream_cheese: 0\n163\t      task_2_salad_dressing: 68\n164\t      task_3_bbq_sauce: 20\n165\t      task_4_ketchup: 8\n166\t      task_5_tomato_sauce: 42\n167\t      task_6_butter: 4\n168\t      task_7_milk: 16\n169\t      task_8_chocolate_pudding: 0\n170\t      task_9_orange_juice: 92\n171\t  result_rationale: 'k=0.7是X-VLA degradation curve的最陡峭转变区间：k=0.9 (97.6%) → k=0.7 (56.2%)\n172\t    跨越了40pp的cliff。在这个phase transition point，微小的perturbation会导致 巨大的outcome variance。Seed44改变了两个关键因素：(1)\n173\t    eval episode的初始state 分布——某些task的初始object placement使得pruning后的degraded policy恰好无法\n174\t    完成（如task_1 cream_cheese在seed42下k=0.7=2%已极低，seed44可能直接0%）； (2) 虽然L2 norm ranking在deterministic\n175\t    forward pass中是固定的，不同episode 的observation sequence触发不同的attention pattern，使得同一组\"被保留\"的token\n176\t    在不同episode中的effective information coverage不同。Seed42恰好采样到6个 relatively robust tasks\n177\t    (>60%)，seed44则大多数task都落入cliff的collapse侧。 28%远低于56.2%的-1σ范围——如果cliff point的variance如此之大，\n178\t    单seed的56.2%不能作为architectural characterization。\n179\t\n180\t    '\n181\t  tables:\n182\t  - name: 'Table: X-VLA k=0.7 Cross-Seed Comparison'\n183\t    columns:\n184\t    - metric\n185\t    - seed42\n186\t    - seed44\n187\t    - delta\n188\t    rows:\n189\t    - - overall_SR\n190\t      - 56.2\n191\t      - 28.0\n192\t      - -28.2\n193\t    - - tasks >60%\n194\t      - 6\n195\t      - 2\n196\t      - -4\n197\t    - - tasks <10%\n198\t      - 3\n199\t      - 4\n200\t      - 1\n201\t    - - per_task_std\n202\t      - 38.5\n203\t      - 28.4\n204\t      - '-'\n205\t  figures_description:\n206\t  - 'X-VLA per-task SR并排柱状图 (seed42 blue, seed44 orange) at k=0.7。 可视化每个task的seed\n207\t    sensitivity。部分task（task_2, task_9）跨seed稳定， 但大多数task seed44大幅下降，说明cliff point的per-task\n208\t    pattern 高度seed-dependent。\n209\t\n210\t    '\n211\t  analysis: '28pp delta（56.2→28.0）远超typical seed variance（通常<8pp for 500 episodes）。\n212\t    这不是统计噪声——cliff位置本身是seed-sensitive的。对于seed42，effective cliff 在k≈0.75；对于seed44，cliff左移到k≈0.85。这意味着X-VLA的\"threshold-graded\"\n213\t    分类中，threshold位置有~10%的k-ratio uncertainty。论文不能用单seed的k=0.7=56.2% 作为precise characterization，只能说\"cliff\n214\t    somewhere in k∈[0.7, 0.9]\"。 在worst叙事中：X-VLA中间类降级为\"suggestive of threshold behavior\n215\t    with high variance at transition\"，不再是clean evidence。\n216\t\n217\t    '\n218\t- name: X-VLA L2-norm pruning k=0.9 seed44\n219\t  plan_id: d108_unified_pruning_protocol\n220\t  description: X-VLA k=0.9 pruning with eval seed44, 500 episodes。原始seed42结果97.6%。\n221\t  expected_results:\n222\t    overall_sr: 91.0\n223\t    ci_95_lower: 88.3\n224\t    ci_95_upper: 93.2\n225\t    original_seed42_sr: 97.6\n226\t    delta_vs_seed42_pp: -6.6\n227\t  result_rationale: 'k=0.9在cliff区间之上，应仍robust。但seed44可能比seed42低约6pp—— 部分task在seed44的eval\n228\t    episodes中初始configuration使得even 10% pruning 导致偶尔failure（如seed42 task_3=92%可能seed44=78%）。91%仍属\"robust\"\n229\t    （>90%），不动摇\"k≥0.9 immune\"的claim，但与seed42的97.6%有差异表明 even在safe zone也有non-trivial\n230\t    seed variance。这比k=0.7的28pp delta温和 很多（6.6pp），确认variance集中在cliff transition处。\n231\t\n232\t    '\n233\t  tables: []\n234\t  figures_description: []\n235\t  analysis: '91%仍属robust，\"k≥0.9 immune\"的claim基本不受影响。但6.6pp的seed variance 说明97.6%不应被over-interpret为near-perfect——更准确的表述是\"~94±4%\n236\t    at k=0.9\"。\n237\t\n238\t    '\n239\t- name: OpenVLA random pruning k=0.7 seed43\n240\t  plan_id: d108_unified_pruning_protocol\n241\t  description: OpenVLA random pruning k=0.7 with eval seed43, 500 episodes。原始seed7结果49.0%。\n242\t  expected_results:\n243\t    overall_sr: 46.0\n244\t    ci_95_lower: 41.7\n245\t    ci_95_upper: 50.4\n246\t    original_seed7_sr: 49.0\n247\t    delta_vs_original_pp: -3.0\n248\t  result_rationale: 'OpenVLA random pruning的variance应较低——random pruning的expected behavior\n249\t    在统计上更稳定因为它不依赖importance ranking的specific order。Seed43 可能比seed7低约3pp，在正常500-episode\n250\t    Wilson CI范围内（±4pp）。 MLP projector的graded degradation pattern对seed不敏感（不像X-VLA的cliff\n251\t    那样在transition point有巨大variance），因为graded pattern没有sharp transition。 3pp差异是normal\n252\t    statistical fluctuation。\n253\t\n254\t    '\n255\t  tables: []\n256\t  figures_description: []\n257\t  analysis: 'OpenVLA random curve跨seed reproducible（delta<5pp），确认MLP graded pattern本身是robust的。问题不在于pattern的robustness，而在于\n258\t    L2 norm vs random的method confound。\n259\t\n260\t    '\n261\t- name: OpenVLA random pruning k=0.5 seed43\n262\t  plan_id: d108_unified_pruning_protocol\n263\t  description: OpenVLA random pruning k=0.5 with eval seed43, 500 episodes。原始seed7结果37.4%。\n264\t  expected_results:\n265\t    overall_sr: 35.0\n266\t    ci_95_lower: 31.0\n267\t    ci_95_upper: 39.2\n268\t    original_seed7_sr: 37.4\n269\t    delta_vs_original_pp: -2.4\n270\t  result_rationale: '同k=0.7，seed43 random在正常variance范围内。2.4pp delta远小于 L2 norm vs\n271\t    random的16pp gap，确认method confound是dominant effect， seed variance是secondary。\n272\t\n273\t    '\n274\t  tables: []\n275\t  figures_description: []\n276\t  analysis: OpenVLA random pruning reproducible。Confound是method-driven非seed-driven。\n277\t- name: OpenVLA VTC-only M=32 eval\n278\t  plan_id: c4_ext_method_universality_openvla\n279\t  description: VTC-only (仅训练VTC module, freeze LLM backbone) M=32 on OpenVLA, 100K\n280\t    steps后LIBERO-Object eval\n281\t  expected_results:\n282\t    overall_sr: 0.0\n283\t    ci_95_upper: 0.76\n284\t    n_episodes: 500\n285\t    failure_mode: action collapse — identical output every step\n286\t    training_loss_100k: 0.028\n287\t    eval_loss_100k: 0.14\n288\t  result_rationale: '与M=128 (D109, 0% SR at 20K steps) 相同的failure mode扩展到M=32。 根因：MLP\n289\t    projector输出的256个token已经是individually meaningful的 action-relevant representations——每个token经过3-layer\n290\t    MLP (GELU) 独立映射了对应vision patch的信息。VTC cross-attention试图将256个token 重新编码为32个query\n291\t    token时，必须决定如何aggregate信息。但在VTC-only 训练模式下，frozen LLM backbone无法适应VTC输出的新representation\n292\t    format。 VTC学到的是最小化training set的reconstruction loss，导致它过拟合到 训练分布的specific token\n293\t    pattern——在eval时面对unseen observation， VTC输出near-identical compressed representation\n294\t    regardless of input， LLM consequently产生identical action sequence。M=32比M=128更aggressive\n295\t    的压缩在此处无help——问题不是compression ratio而是VTC在MLP projector token上的fundamental mismatch。Pixel-shuffle\n296\t    token是spatially entangled的 （CV=0.314，information分布在channel维度），VTC可以学到有效的spatial\n297\t    re-organization；MLP projector token是partially independent的 （CV=0.215，information在individual\n298\t    token level有meaning），VTC的 cross-attention机制反而破坏了这种independence。\n299\t\n300\t    '\n301\t  tables:\n302\t  - name: 'Table C4-ext: OpenVLA VTC All M Values (Worst Tier)'\n303\t    columns:\n304\t    - M\n305\t    - compression\n306\t    - sr_pct\n307\t    - failure_mode\n308\t    rows:\n309\t    - - 32\n310\t      - 87.5%\n311\t      - 0\n312\t      - action collapse (identical output)\n313\t    - - 64\n314\t      - 50%\n315\t      - 2\n316\t      - near-collapse (rare sporadic success)\n317\t    - - 96\n318\t      - 25%\n319\t      - 0\n320\t      - action collapse\n321\t    - - 128\n322\t      - 0% (passthrough)\n323\t      - 0\n324\t      - confirmed D109 — action collapse at 20K\n325\t  figures_description:\n326\t  - '对比图：SmolVLA VTC M-curve (flat ~58%) vs OpenVLA VTC M-curve (flat ~0%)。 两条horizontal\n327\t    lines在完全不同的level。SmolVLA侧标注\"re-encoding repairs spatial entanglement\"；OpenVLA侧标注\"re-encoding\n328\t    destroys token independence\"。 强化VTR是connector-specific solution的结论。\n329\t\n330\t    '\n331\t  analysis: 'M=32/64/96/128全部失败（0-2% SR），排除了\"M=128压缩太极端\"的alternative explanation。VTR在MLP\n332\t    projector上的failure是fundamental的，不是hyperparameter tuning问题。在worst叙事中，这实际上是一个clean\n333\t    result：VTR是pixel-shuffle 专用修复方案，对MLP projector反而harmful。Claim 4的scope必须限定为 \"VTR\n334\t    recovers pixel-shuffle cliff-edge\"而非\"universal compression\"。 这收窄了method contribution但使claim更bulletproof。\n335\t\n336\t    '\n337\t- name: OpenVLA VTC-only M=64 eval\n338\t  plan_id: c4_ext_method_universality_openvla\n339\t  description: VTC-only M=64 on OpenVLA, LIBERO-Object eval\n340\t  expected_results:\n341\t    overall_sr: 2.0\n342\t    ci_95_lower: 1.0\n343\t    ci_95_upper: 3.8\n344\t    n_episodes: 500\n345\t    failure_mode: near-collapse with sporadic success\n346\t  result_rationale: 'M=64（50%压缩）给VTC更多空间保留原始信息，比M=32/M=128略好但仍本质失败。 50% compression意味着VTC的128个query\n347\t    token中每个只需aggregate约2个原始token 的信息，reconstruction burden最轻。可能在个别easy task的easy\n348\t    episode上 偶尔成功（如task_6_butter baseline SR=82%，即使degraded policy也可能 在optimal initial\n349\t    configuration下完成）。但2%与0%无实质区别—— Wilson CI重叠，不能claim任何meaningful performance。\n350\t\n351\t    '\n352\t  tables: []\n353\t  figures_description: []\n354\t  analysis: M=64的2%是statistical noise，不改变'VTC on MLP projector = failure'的结论。\n355\t- name: OpenVLA VTC M=32 (M-sweep plan)\n356\t  plan_id: c4_ext_openvla_msweep\n357\t  description: OpenVLA smart compress M=32 VTC-only training, 100K steps, LIBERO-Object\n358\t    eval。与c4_ext同一batch实验。\n359\t  expected_results:\n360\t    overall_sr: 0.0\n361\t    ci_95_upper: 0.76\n362\t    training_converged: true\n363\t    training_loss_final: 0.028\n364\t  result_rationale: 'train_openvla_sc_m32_vtconly_seed42 (RUNNING) 的预期结果。 同c4_ext_method_universality_openvla的M=32分析——VTC-only在OpenVLA上\n365\t    across所有M值失败。Training可能converge（loss下降），但learned representation 对eval distribution泛化失败。\n366\t\n367\t    '\n368\t  tables: []\n369\t  figures_description: []\n370\t  analysis: M=32 VTC-only失败，与M=128 D109一致。\n371\t- name: OpenVLA VTC M=64 (M-sweep plan)\n372\t  plan_id: c4_ext_openvla_msweep\n373\t  description: OpenVLA smart compress M=64, train_openvla_sc_m64_seed42_v3 (RUNNING)\n374\t  expected_results:\n375\t    overall_sr: 2.0\n376\t    training_converged: true\n377\t  result_rationale: 'v3版本可能修复了v1/v2的training bug但不改变fundamental outcome—— VTC在MLP\n378\t    projector token上的mismatch是architectural，不是implementation问题。\n379\t\n380\t    '\n381\t  tables: []\n382\t  figures_description: []\n383\t  analysis: v3 restart不改变architectural mismatch。\n384\t- name: OpenVLA VTC M=96 (M-sweep plan)\n385\t  plan_id: c4_ext_openvla_msweep\n386\t  description: OpenVLA smart compress M=96, train_openvla_sc_m96_seed42_v3 (RUNNING)\n387\t  expected_results:\n388\t    overall_sr: 0.0\n389\t    ci_95_upper: 0.76\n390\t  result_rationale: 'M=96仅25%压缩（256→96），接近passthrough。但即使near-passthrough， VTC的cross-attention\n391\t    forward pass会restructure token representation， 破坏MLP projector建立的per-token independence。类似M=128\n392\t    passthrough 在SmolVLA上works（因为re-encoding恰好修复entanglement），但在OpenVLA上 M=128 passthrough=0%（因为re-encoding破坏independence）。\n393\t    M=96同理——不是compression的问题而是re-encoding本身的问题。\n394\t\n395\t    '\n396\t  tables: []\n397\t  figures_description: []\n398\t  analysis: Near-passthrough M=96仍失败，排除compression artifact。\n399\t- name: SmolVLA VTR M=32 3-seed final (worst tier confirmation)\n400\t  plan_id: c4_learned_reencoding_smolvla\n401\t  description: 已完成实验的worst tier确认。M=32 cross-attn 3-seed已有数据。\n402\t  expected_results:\n403\t    m32_3seed_mean: 60.1\n404\t    m32_3seed_std: 1.3\n405\t    m32_seed42: 61.6\n406\t    m32_seed43: 59.2\n407\t    m32_seed44: 59.6\n408\t    baseline_sr: 44.8\n409\t    pruning_sr: 0.0\n410\t  result_rationale: 'SmolVLA VTR数据已完整收集，不受worst tier影响。所有3-seed评估在[58, 65] 范围内（与worst\n411\t    tier定义的smolvla_vtr_m32_sr一致）。这是worst叙事中 最强的正面证据：VTR在pixel-shuffle上从0%恢复到60%+是iron-clad的。\n412\t    3-seed std=1.3%极低，排除lucky seed。Cross-suite（Spatial 53.2%, Goal 56.4%）进一步确认泛化性。\n413\t\n414\t    '\n415\t  tables: []\n416\t  figures_description: []\n417\t  analysis: 'SmolVLA VTR数据不需要修改。在worst叙事中，这是核心positive contribution： \"pixel-shuffle\n418\t    cliff-edge + VTR recovery\"成为论文的主干。\n419\t\n420\t    '\n421\t- name: SmolVLA VTR M-curve flat confirmation\n422\t  plan_id: c4_learned_reencoding_smolvla\n423\t  description: M=16/32/64/96/128全sweep 3-seed数据已完成。确认M-curve flat。\n424\t  expected_results:\n425\t    m16_mean: 56.9\n426\t    m32_mean: 60.1\n427\t    m64_mean: 62.0\n428\t    m96_mean: 54.5\n429\t    m128_mean: 58.0\n430\t    range_pp: 7.5\n431\t    all_within_5pp_of_baseline: true\n432\t  result_rationale: '已有数据确认M-curve flat（所有M值在54.5-62.0%范围内，max spread 7.5pp）。 这证明VTR对pixel-shuffle\n433\t    connector实现near-lossless compression at any ratio—— M=16（87.5%压缩）与M=128（passthrough）performance无统计差异。\n434\t    Worst tier不影响此结论，因为数据已locked。\n435\t\n436\t    '\n437\t  tables:\n438\t  - name: 'Table C4: SmolVLA VTR M-Curve (3-seed, confirmed)'\n439\t    columns:\n440\t    - M\n441\t    - compression\n442\t    - mean_SR\n443\t    - std\n444\t    - vs 0% pruning\n445\t    rows:\n446\t    - - 16\n447\t      - 87.5%\n448\t      - 56.9\n449\t      - 1.3\n450\t      - +56.9pp\n451\t    - - 32\n452\t      - 75%\n453\t      - 60.1\n454\t      - 1.3\n455\t      - +60.1pp\n456\t    - - 64\n457\t      - 50%\n458\t      - 62.0\n459\t      - 2.3\n460\t      - +62.0pp\n461\t    - - 96\n462\t      - 25%\n463\t      - 54.5\n464\t      - 3.2\n465\t      - +54.5pp\n466\t    - - 128\n467\t      - 0%\n468\t      - 58.0\n469\t      - 3.5\n470\t      - +58.0pp\n471\t  figures_description: []\n472\t  analysis: M-curve flat是VTR方法的最强证据——对pixel-shuffle实现任意压缩比。\n473\t- name: RoboFlamingo LIBERO-Object baseline\n474\t  plan_id: c5_third_connector_roboflamingo\n475\t  description: RoboFlamingo (Perceiver Resampler connector) fine-tune on LIBERO-Object,\n476\t    baseline SR evaluation\n477\t  expected_results:\n478\t    status: not_completed_before_deadline\n479\t    estimated_sr: null\n480\t    training_convergence: unknown\n481\t    days_required: 3\n482\t    days_remaining: 6\n483\t  result_rationale: '距CoRL abstract截止6天（May 26），paper截止9天（May 29）。 RoboFlamingo需要：(1)\n484\t    代码适配LIBERO（OpenFlamingo→RoboFlamingo→LIBERO， 可能需要1-2天debug action space/observation\n485\t    format差异）； (2) fine-tuning ≥100K steps（~8-12小时single GPU）； (3) baseline eval 500×10\n486\t    episodes（~4-6小时）； (4) pruning sweep至少3个k值（额外~12小时）； (5) importance分析（CV, entropy,\n487\t    额外~2小时）。 总计需要~3天clean execution + debug time。考虑到GPU资源竞争 （其他实验也在使用），且RoboFlamingo的LIBERO适配从未被验证过\n488\t    （train_c5_roboflamingo_v2已killed），在worst scenario下这个实验 被deprioritized。即使baseline完成，pruning\n489\t    sweep也来不及写入paper。\n490\t\n491\t    '\n492\t  tables: []\n493\t  figures_description: []\n494\t  analysis: 'C5在deadline前无法完成。在worst叙事中，收窄scope后不再需要第5个模型—— 论文聚焦pixel-shuffle catastrophe\n495\t    + linear immunity两个极端， 不主张exhaustive connector coverage。Perceiver Resampler列入\n496\t    Limitations & Future Work：\"We leave Perceiver-style connectors (e.g., Flamingo)\n497\t    to future work.\"\n498\t\n499\t    '\n500\t- name: RoboFlamingo pruning sweep (if baseline completes)\n501\t  plan_id: c5_third_connector_roboflamingo\n502\t  description: RoboFlamingo pruning k=0.5/0.7/0.9 + importance CV analysis。依赖baseline完成。\n503\t  expected_results:\n504\t    status: not_attempted\n505\t    blocked_by: baseline not completed\n506\t  result_rationale: 'Baseline未完成，pruning sweep无法开始。即使在parallel universe中baseline 完成且SR>40%，Perceiver\n507\t    Resampler的pruning behavior prediction是uncertain—— Perceiver使用learned query tokens\n508\t    cross-attend to vision features， 理论上介于linear projection和pixel-shuffle之间。CV预测值可能在0.1-0.2范围。\n509\t    但这些是speculation，无法在deadline前验证。\n510\t\n511\t    '\n512\t  tables: []\n513\t  figures_description: []\n514\t  analysis: 无法在deadline前完成，全部列入future work。\n515\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"b1a54116-c461-4e8a-8039-725147cd9263","uuid":"e51ecbfb-4ad0-47c7-aa00-3df0c4967dc5","timestamp":"2026-05-20T16:53:04.182Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-be-idea-gen-0515-2/projects/importance_margin_vla_compress/artifacts/dream_reports/dream_20260520T155932/worst/review_context.yaml","content":"narrative_guidance: 'Reframe为\"cautionary tale + diagnostic tool\"。核心论点从clean 4-class\n  taxonomy 退守到两个不可动摇的极端：pixel-shuffle catastrophic collapse（数据铁证） 和 pure linear projection\n  immunity（π0 offline数据）。中间类（MLP graded、 threshold-graded）承认pruning method confound，降级为\"suggestive\n  evidence\"。 论文重心转向：(1) 首次发现pixel-shuffle对任何pruning都catastrophic—— 这一发现alone就值一篇paper（4篇concurrent\n  work全忽略了pixel-shuffle VLA）； (2) CV诊断作为practitioner zero-cost工具（不依赖跨模型公平比较）； (3)\n  VTR作为pixel-shuffle专用修复。标题改为\"Token Pruning Catastrophically Fails on Pixel-Shuffle\n  VLAs: Diagnosis and Recovery\"——收窄scope但claims 更bulletproof。仍冲CoRL，不降级venue。\n\n  '\nimagined_experiments:\n- name: OpenVLA L2-norm pruning k=0.95\n  plan_id: d108_unified_pruning_protocol\n  description: OpenVLA L2-norm importance-based pruning at k=0.95 (keep 95%), 500\n    episodes LIBERO-Object. 与random k=0.95 (69.4%) 对比。\n  expected_results:\n    overall_sr: 52.0\n    ci_95_lower: 47.7\n    ci_95_upper: 56.3\n    n_episodes: 500\n    random_k095_reference_sr: 69.4\n    delta_vs_random_pp: -17.4\n  result_rationale: 'L2 norm在MLP projector上系统性劣于random。3-layer MLP (GELU)的非线性混合 使L2\n    norm与task relevance解耦：GELU激活压缩后，low-norm token可能携带经过 非线性变换的关键spatial feature（幅度小但信息密度高），而high-norm\n    token可能 被MLP放大但携带冗余信息。Random pruning保留信息的均匀采样，L2 norm则系统性 移除task-critical但low-magnitude的token。即使仅移除5%（约13个token），\n    L2 norm选中的13个恰好rich in action-relevant info，导致17pp drop。 这暴露了跨模型比较的根本confound——OpenVLA用random测到69.4%，\n    X-VLA用L2 norm测到99.0%，但方法差异贡献了约17pp。\n\n    '\n  tables: []\n  figures_description: []\n  analysis: '仅移除5% token即出现17pp gap，证实confound是系统性的而非个别k值偶然。\n\n    '\n- name: OpenVLA L2-norm pruning k=0.9\n  plan_id: d108_unified_pruning_protocol\n  description: OpenVLA L2-norm pruning at k=0.9 (keep 90%), 500 episodes LIBERO-Object\n  expected_results:\n    overall_sr: 44.0\n    ci_95_lower: 39.7\n    ci_95_upper: 48.4\n    n_episodes: 500\n    random_k09_reference_sr: 62.0\n    delta_vs_random_pp: -18.0\n  result_rationale: '移除10%时gap扩大到18pp。L2 norm移除的26个token中包含更多action-critical 信息。MLP\n    projector的GELU非线性使得norm分布与gradient-based importance 呈弱负相关——plan_009_token_importance已证实spearman仅0.407，意味着\n    L2 norm是一个misleading proxy。Random在期望值上保留每个importance quartile 的equal representation，而L2\n    norm over-prune低norm quartile（恰好是 gradient-important的那部分）。18pp gap在500 episode\n    Wilson CI下 高度显著（各自CI约±4pp，不重叠）。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table D108: OpenVLA Pruning Method Comparison (Full Sweep)'\n    columns:\n    - k\n    - random_SR\n    - l2norm_SR\n    - delta_pp\n    - confound_significant\n    rows:\n    - - 0.95\n      - 69.4\n      - 52.0\n      - -17.4\n      - yes (>15pp)\n    - - 0.9\n      - 62.0\n      - 44.0\n      - -18.0\n      - yes (>15pp)\n    - - 0.7\n      - 49.0\n      - 31.0\n      - -18.0\n      - yes (>15pp)\n    - - 0.5\n      - 37.4\n      - 21.0\n      - -16.4\n      - yes (>15pp)\n    - - 0.3\n      - 20.6\n      - 7.0\n      - -13.6\n      - marginal\n  figures_description:\n  - '双线对比图：OpenVLA random (blue) vs L2-norm (red) degradation curves, x=k ratio, y=SR%。两条线之间shaded\n    area标注\"pruning method confound\"。 Gap在k=0.7-0.95最宽（17-18pp），k=0.3处因floor effect收窄至~14pp。\n    右侧annotation box: \"Cross-model comparison between OpenVLA-random and X-VLA-L2norm\n    curves is confounded by ~17pp method effect.\"\n\n    '\n  analysis: 'L2 norm全面劣于random（平均约17pp），暴露了核心confound：现有OpenVLA degradation curve用random测得，X-VLA\n    curve用L2 norm测得。X-VLA k=0.9 的97.6%如果换用random可能更高（或保持），但OpenVLA k=0.9的62%如果换用 L2\n    norm仅44%。两条curve之间的gap部分来自pruning method，非纯connector差异。 Taxonomy的MLP-graded与threshold-graded的separation不再clean——\n    论文必须承认中间两类的比较被method confound污染，只保留极端类 （pixel-shuffle catastrophic, pure linear\n    immune）作为iron-clad claims。\n\n    '\n- name: OpenVLA L2-norm pruning k=0.7\n  plan_id: d108_unified_pruning_protocol\n  description: OpenVLA L2-norm pruning at k=0.7, 500 episodes LIBERO-Object\n  expected_results:\n    overall_sr: 31.0\n    ci_95_lower: 27.1\n    ci_95_upper: 35.2\n    random_k07_reference_sr: 49.0\n    delta_vs_random_pp: -18.0\n  result_rationale: 'k=0.7区间gap与k=0.9持平（~18pp）。移除30%时，L2 norm系统性地清除了 low-norm quartile的全部token，而这些token恰好是MLP非线性变换后的\n    compressed representation of spatial information。此时L2 norm的31% 接近X-VLA random\n    k=0.5的预期表现，进一步模糊了\"MLP graded vs threshold-graded\"的边界。\n\n    '\n  tables: []\n  figures_description: []\n  analysis: 18pp gap持续存在，k=0.7是关键比较点因为X-VLA在此处cliff。\n- name: OpenVLA L2-norm pruning k=0.5\n  plan_id: d108_unified_pruning_protocol\n  description: OpenVLA L2-norm pruning at k=0.5, 500 episodes LIBERO-Object\n  expected_results:\n    overall_sr: 21.0\n    ci_95_lower: 17.6\n    ci_95_upper: 24.8\n    random_k05_reference_sr: 37.4\n    delta_vs_random_pp: -16.4\n  result_rationale: '移除50%时gap略收窄至16pp，因为两种方法都已接近severe degradation区间。 但21% vs 37.4%仍是显著差异（CI不重叠）。Floor\n    compression使极端差异 在绝对值上缩小但在相对值上保持——L2 norm的21%是random 37.4%的56%。\n\n    '\n  tables: []\n  figures_description: []\n  analysis: Gap保持>15pp，confound across全部中间k值。\n- name: OpenVLA L2-norm pruning k=0.3\n  plan_id: d108_unified_pruning_protocol\n  description: OpenVLA L2-norm pruning at k=0.3, 500 episodes LIBERO-Object\n  expected_results:\n    overall_sr: 7.0\n    ci_95_lower: 5.0\n    ci_95_upper: 9.7\n    random_k03_reference_sr: 20.6\n    delta_vs_random_pp: -13.6\n  result_rationale: '保留仅30% token时两种方法都严重退化。L2 norm的7%接近collapse—— 保留的77个token中，L2\n    norm选择的top-30%恰好偏向high-magnitude但 low-information的token。Gap收窄至14pp因为random也已接近failure\n    zone。 Floor effect：当base rate低于20%时，能损失的空间本身有限。\n\n    '\n  tables: []\n  figures_description: []\n  analysis: Floor effect使gap收窄，但方向一致——L2 norm在MLP projector上是inferior metric。\n- name: X-VLA L2-norm pruning k=0.7 seed44\n  plan_id: d108_unified_pruning_protocol\n  description: X-VLA k=0.7 pruning with eval seed44, 500 episodes LIBERO-Object。原始seed42结果56.2%。测试cliff\n    pattern跨seed稳健性。\n  expected_results:\n    overall_sr: 28.0\n    ci_95_lower: 24.2\n    ci_95_upper: 32.1\n    n_episodes: 500\n    original_seed42_sr: 56.2\n    delta_vs_seed42_pp: -28.2\n    per_task_sr_sketch:\n      task_0_alphabet_soup: 30\n      task_1_cream_cheese: 0\n      task_2_salad_dressing: 68\n      task_3_bbq_sauce: 20\n      task_4_ketchup: 8\n      task_5_tomato_sauce: 42\n      task_6_butter: 4\n      task_7_milk: 16\n      task_8_chocolate_pudding: 0\n      task_9_orange_juice: 92\n  result_rationale: 'k=0.7是X-VLA degradation curve的最陡峭转变区间：k=0.9 (97.6%) → k=0.7 (56.2%)\n    跨越了40pp的cliff。在这个phase transition point，微小的perturbation会导致 巨大的outcome variance。Seed44改变了两个关键因素：(1)\n    eval episode的初始state 分布——某些task的初始object placement使得pruning后的degraded policy恰好无法\n    完成（如task_1 cream_cheese在seed42下k=0.7=2%已极低，seed44可能直接0%）； (2) 虽然L2 norm ranking在deterministic\n    forward pass中是固定的，不同episode 的observation sequence触发不同的attention pattern，使得同一组\"被保留\"的token\n    在不同episode中的effective information coverage不同。Seed42恰好采样到6个 relatively robust tasks\n    (>60%)，seed44则大多数task都落入cliff的collapse侧。 28%远低于56.2%的-1σ范围——如果cliff point的variance如此之大，\n    单seed的56.2%不能作为architectural characterization。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table: X-VLA k=0.7 Cross-Seed Comparison'\n    columns:\n    - metric\n    - seed42\n    - seed44\n    - delta\n    rows:\n    - - overall_SR\n      - 56.2\n      - 28.0\n      - -28.2\n    - - tasks >60%\n      - 6\n      - 2\n      - -4\n    - - tasks <10%\n      - 3\n      - 4\n      - 1\n    - - per_task_std\n      - 38.5\n      - 28.4\n      - '-'\n  figures_description:\n  - 'X-VLA per-task SR并排柱状图 (seed42 blue, seed44 orange) at k=0.7。 可视化每个task的seed\n    sensitivity。部分task（task_2, task_9）跨seed稳定， 但大多数task seed44大幅下降，说明cliff point的per-task\n    pattern 高度seed-dependent。\n\n    '\n  analysis: '28pp delta（56.2→28.0）远超typical seed variance（通常<8pp for 500 episodes）。\n    这不是统计噪声——cliff位置本身是seed-sensitive的。对于seed42，effective cliff 在k≈0.75；对于seed44，cliff左移到k≈0.85。这意味着X-VLA的\"threshold-graded\"\n    分类中，threshold位置有~10%的k-ratio uncertainty。论文不能用单seed的k=0.7=56.2% 作为precise characterization，只能说\"cliff\n    somewhere in k∈[0.7, 0.9]\"。 在worst叙事中：X-VLA中间类降级为\"suggestive of threshold behavior\n    with high variance at transition\"，不再是clean evidence。\n\n    '\n- name: X-VLA L2-norm pruning k=0.9 seed44\n  plan_id: d108_unified_pruning_protocol\n  description: X-VLA k=0.9 pruning with eval seed44, 500 episodes。原始seed42结果97.6%。\n  expected_results:\n    overall_sr: 91.0\n    ci_95_lower: 88.3\n    ci_95_upper: 93.2\n    original_seed42_sr: 97.6\n    delta_vs_seed42_pp: -6.6\n  result_rationale: 'k=0.9在cliff区间之上，应仍robust。但seed44可能比seed42低约6pp—— 部分task在seed44的eval\n    episodes中初始configuration使得even 10% pruning 导致偶尔failure（如seed42 task_3=92%可能seed44=78%）。91%仍属\"robust\"\n    （>90%），不动摇\"k≥0.9 immune\"的claim，但与seed42的97.6%有差异表明 even在safe zone也有non-trivial\n    seed variance。这比k=0.7的28pp delta温和 很多（6.6pp），确认variance集中在cliff transition处。\n\n    '\n  tables: []\n  figures_description: []\n  analysis: '91%仍属robust，\"k≥0.9 immune\"的claim基本不受影响。但6.6pp的seed variance 说明97.6%不应被over-interpret为near-perfect——更准确的表述是\"~94±4%\n    at k=0.9\"。\n\n    '\n- name: OpenVLA random pruning k=0.7 seed43\n  plan_id: d108_unified_pruning_protocol\n  description: OpenVLA random pruning k=0.7 with eval seed43, 500 episodes。原始seed7结果49.0%。\n  expected_results:\n    overall_sr: 46.0\n    ci_95_lower: 41.7\n    ci_95_upper: 50.4\n    original_seed7_sr: 49.0\n    delta_vs_original_pp: -3.0\n  result_rationale: 'OpenVLA random pruning的variance应较低——random pruning的expected behavior\n    在统计上更稳定因为它不依赖importance ranking的specific order。Seed43 可能比seed7低约3pp，在正常500-episode\n    Wilson CI范围内（±4pp）。 MLP projector的graded degradation pattern对seed不敏感（不像X-VLA的cliff\n    那样在transition point有巨大variance），因为graded pattern没有sharp transition。 3pp差异是normal\n    statistical fluctuation。\n\n    '\n  tables: []\n  figures_description: []\n  analysis: 'OpenVLA random curve跨seed reproducible（delta<5pp），确认MLP graded pattern本身是robust的。问题不在于pattern的robustness，而在于\n    L2 norm vs random的method confound。\n\n    '\n- name: OpenVLA random pruning k=0.5 seed43\n  plan_id: d108_unified_pruning_protocol\n  description: OpenVLA random pruning k=0.5 with eval seed43, 500 episodes。原始seed7结果37.4%。\n  expected_results:\n    overall_sr: 35.0\n    ci_95_lower: 31.0\n    ci_95_upper: 39.2\n    original_seed7_sr: 37.4\n    delta_vs_original_pp: -2.4\n  result_rationale: '同k=0.7，seed43 random在正常variance范围内。2.4pp delta远小于 L2 norm vs\n    random的16pp gap，确认method confound是dominant effect， seed variance是secondary。\n\n    '\n  tables: []\n  figures_description: []\n  analysis: OpenVLA random pruning reproducible。Confound是method-driven非seed-driven。\n- name: OpenVLA VTC-only M=32 eval\n  plan_id: c4_ext_method_universality_openvla\n  description: VTC-only (仅训练VTC module, freeze LLM backbone) M=32 on OpenVLA, 100K\n    steps后LIBERO-Object eval\n  expected_results:\n    overall_sr: 0.0\n    ci_95_upper: 0.76\n    n_episodes: 500\n    failure_mode: action collapse — identical output every step\n    training_loss_100k: 0.028\n    eval_loss_100k: 0.14\n  result_rationale: '与M=128 (D109, 0% SR at 20K steps) 相同的failure mode扩展到M=32。 根因：MLP\n    projector输出的256个token已经是individually meaningful的 action-relevant representations——每个token经过3-layer\n    MLP (GELU) 独立映射了对应vision patch的信息。VTC cross-attention试图将256个token 重新编码为32个query\n    token时，必须决定如何aggregate信息。但在VTC-only 训练模式下，frozen LLM backbone无法适应VTC输出的新representation\n    format。 VTC学到的是最小化training set的reconstruction loss，导致它过拟合到 训练分布的specific token\n    pattern——在eval时面对unseen observation， VTC输出near-identical compressed representation\n    regardless of input， LLM consequently产生identical action sequence。M=32比M=128更aggressive\n    的压缩在此处无help——问题不是compression ratio而是VTC在MLP projector token上的fundamental mismatch。Pixel-shuffle\n    token是spatially entangled的 （CV=0.314，information分布在channel维度），VTC可以学到有效的spatial\n    re-organization；MLP projector token是partially independent的 （CV=0.215，information在individual\n    token level有meaning），VTC的 cross-attention机制反而破坏了这种independence。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table C4-ext: OpenVLA VTC All M Values (Worst Tier)'\n    columns:\n    - M\n    - compression\n    - sr_pct\n    - failure_mode\n    rows:\n    - - 32\n      - 87.5%\n      - 0\n      - action collapse (identical output)\n    - - 64\n      - 50%\n      - 2\n      - near-collapse (rare sporadic success)\n    - - 96\n      - 25%\n      - 0\n      - action collapse\n    - - 128\n      - 0% (passthrough)\n      - 0\n      - confirmed D109 — action collapse at 20K\n  figures_description:\n  - '对比图：SmolVLA VTC M-curve (flat ~58%) vs OpenVLA VTC M-curve (flat ~0%)。 两条horizontal\n    lines在完全不同的level。SmolVLA侧标注\"re-encoding repairs spatial entanglement\"；OpenVLA侧标注\"re-encoding\n    destroys token independence\"。 强化VTR是connector-specific solution的结论。\n\n    '\n  analysis: 'M=32/64/96/128全部失败（0-2% SR），排除了\"M=128压缩太极端\"的alternative explanation。VTR在MLP\n    projector上的failure是fundamental的，不是hyperparameter tuning问题。在worst叙事中，这实际上是一个clean\n    result：VTR是pixel-shuffle 专用修复方案，对MLP projector反而harmful。Claim 4的scope必须限定为 \"VTR\n    recovers pixel-shuffle cliff-edge\"而非\"universal compression\"。 这收窄了method contribution但使claim更bulletproof。\n\n    '\n- name: OpenVLA VTC-only M=64 eval\n  plan_id: c4_ext_method_universality_openvla\n  description: VTC-only M=64 on OpenVLA, LIBERO-Object eval\n  expected_results:\n    overall_sr: 2.0\n    ci_95_lower: 1.0\n    ci_95_upper: 3.8\n    n_episodes: 500\n    failure_mode: near-collapse with sporadic success\n  result_rationale: 'M=64（50%压缩）给VTC更多空间保留原始信息，比M=32/M=128略好但仍本质失败。 50% compression意味着VTC的128个query\n    token中每个只需aggregate约2个原始token 的信息，reconstruction burden最轻。可能在个别easy task的easy\n    episode上 偶尔成功（如task_6_butter baseline SR=82%，即使degraded policy也可能 在optimal initial\n    configuration下完成）。但2%与0%无实质区别—— Wilson CI重叠，不能claim任何meaningful performance。\n\n    '\n  tables: []\n  figures_description: []\n  analysis: M=64的2%是statistical noise，不改变'VTC on MLP projector = failure'的结论。\n- name: OpenVLA VTC M=32 (M-sweep plan)\n  plan_id: c4_ext_openvla_msweep\n  description: OpenVLA smart compress M=32 VTC-only training, 100K steps, LIBERO-Object\n    eval。与c4_ext同一batch实验。\n  expected_results:\n    overall_sr: 0.0\n    ci_95_upper: 0.76\n    training_converged: true\n    training_loss_final: 0.028\n  result_rationale: 'train_openvla_sc_m32_vtconly_seed42 (RUNNING) 的预期结果。 同c4_ext_method_universality_openvla的M=32分析——VTC-only在OpenVLA上\n    across所有M值失败。Training可能converge（loss下降），但learned representation 对eval distribution泛化失败。\n\n    '\n  tables: []\n  figures_description: []\n  analysis: M=32 VTC-only失败，与M=128 D109一致。\n- name: OpenVLA VTC M=64 (M-sweep plan)\n  plan_id: c4_ext_openvla_msweep\n  description: OpenVLA smart compress M=64, train_openvla_sc_m64_seed42_v3 (RUNNING)\n  expected_results:\n    overall_sr: 2.0\n    training_converged: true\n  result_rationale: 'v3版本可能修复了v1/v2的training bug但不改变fundamental outcome—— VTC在MLP\n    projector token上的mismatch是architectural，不是implementation问题。\n\n    '\n  tables: []\n  figures_description: []\n  analysis: v3 restart不改变architectural mismatch。\n- name: OpenVLA VTC M=96 (M-sweep plan)\n  plan_id: c4_ext_openvla_msweep\n  description: OpenVLA smart compress M=96, train_openvla_sc_m96_seed42_v3 (RUNNING)\n  expected_results:\n    overall_sr: 0.0\n    ci_95_upper: 0.76\n  result_rationale: 'M=96仅25%压缩（256→96），接近passthrough。但即使near-passthrough， VTC的cross-attention\n    forward pass会restructure token representation， 破坏MLP projector建立的per-token independence。类似M=128\n    passthrough 在SmolVLA上works（因为re-encoding恰好修复entanglement），但在OpenVLA上 M=128 passthrough=0%（因为re-encoding破坏independence）。\n    M=96同理——不是compression的问题而是re-encoding本身的问题。\n\n    '\n  tables: []\n  figures_description: []\n  analysis: Near-passthrough M=96仍失败，排除compression artifact。\n- name: SmolVLA VTR M=32 3-seed final (worst tier confirmation)\n  plan_id: c4_learned_reencoding_smolvla\n  description: 已完成实验的worst tier确认。M=32 cross-attn 3-seed已有数据。\n  expected_results:\n    m32_3seed_mean: 60.1\n    m32_3seed_std: 1.3\n    m32_seed42: 61.6\n    m32_seed43: 59.2\n    m32_seed44: 59.6\n    baseline_sr: 44.8\n    pruning_sr: 0.0\n  result_rationale: 'SmolVLA VTR数据已完整收集，不受worst tier影响。所有3-seed评估在[58, 65] 范围内（与worst\n    tier定义的smolvla_vtr_m32_sr一致）。这是worst叙事中 最强的正面证据：VTR在pixel-shuffle上从0%恢复到60%+是iron-clad的。\n    3-seed std=1.3%极低，排除lucky seed。Cross-suite（Spatial 53.2%, Goal 56.4%）进一步确认泛化性。\n\n    '\n  tables: []\n  figures_description: []\n  analysis: 'SmolVLA VTR数据不需要修改。在worst叙事中，这是核心positive contribution： \"pixel-shuffle\n    cliff-edge + VTR recovery\"成为论文的主干。\n\n    '\n- name: SmolVLA VTR M-curve flat confirmation\n  plan_id: c4_learned_reencoding_smolvla\n  description: M=16/32/64/96/128全sweep 3-seed数据已完成。确认M-curve flat。\n  expected_results:\n    m16_mean: 56.9\n    m32_mean: 60.1\n    m64_mean: 62.0\n    m96_mean: 54.5\n    m128_mean: 58.0\n    range_pp: 7.5\n    all_within_5pp_of_baseline: true\n  result_rationale: '已有数据确认M-curve flat（所有M值在54.5-62.0%范围内，max spread 7.5pp）。 这证明VTR对pixel-shuffle\n    connector实现near-lossless compression at any ratio—— M=16（87.5%压缩）与M=128（passthrough）performance无统计差异。\n    Worst tier不影响此结论，因为数据已locked。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table C4: SmolVLA VTR M-Curve (3-seed, confirmed)'\n    columns:\n    - M\n    - compression\n    - mean_SR\n    - std\n    - vs 0% pruning\n    rows:\n    - - 16\n      - 87.5%\n      - 56.9\n      - 1.3\n      - +56.9pp\n    - - 32\n      - 75%\n      - 60.1\n      - 1.3\n      - +60.1pp\n    - - 64\n      - 50%\n      - 62.0\n      - 2.3\n      - +62.0pp\n    - - 96\n      - 25%\n      - 54.5\n      - 3.2\n      - +54.5pp\n    - - 128\n      - 0%\n      - 58.0\n      - 3.5\n      - +58.0pp\n  figures_description: []\n  analysis: M-curve flat是VTR方法的最强证据——对pixel-shuffle实现任意压缩比。\n- name: RoboFlamingo LIBERO-Object baseline\n  plan_id: c5_third_connector_roboflamingo\n  description: RoboFlamingo (Perceiver Resampler connector) fine-tune on LIBERO-Object,\n    baseline SR evaluation\n  expected_results:\n    status: not_completed_before_deadline\n    estimated_sr: null\n    training_convergence: unknown\n    days_required: 3\n    days_remaining: 6\n  result_rationale: '距CoRL abstract截止6天（May 26），paper截止9天（May 29）。 RoboFlamingo需要：(1)\n    代码适配LIBERO（OpenFlamingo→RoboFlamingo→LIBERO， 可能需要1-2天debug action space/observation\n    format差异）； (2) fine-tuning ≥100K steps（~8-12小时single GPU）； (3) baseline eval 500×10\n    episodes（~4-6小时）； (4) pruning sweep至少3个k值（额外~12小时）； (5) importance分析（CV, entropy,\n    额外~2小时）。 总计需要~3天clean execution + debug time。考虑到GPU资源竞争 （其他实验也在使用），且RoboFlamingo的LIBERO适配从未被验证过\n    （train_c5_roboflamingo_v2已killed），在worst scenario下这个实验 被deprioritized。即使baseline完成，pruning\n    sweep也来不及写入paper。\n\n    '\n  tables: []\n  figures_description: []\n  analysis: 'C5在deadline前无法完成。在worst叙事中，收窄scope后不再需要第5个模型—— 论文聚焦pixel-shuffle catastrophe\n    + linear immunity两个极端， 不主张exhaustive connector coverage。Perceiver Resampler列入\n    Limitations & Future Work：\"We leave Perceiver-style connectors (e.g., Flamingo)\n    to future work.\"\n\n    '\n- name: RoboFlamingo pruning sweep (if baseline completes)\n  plan_id: c5_third_connector_roboflamingo\n  description: RoboFlamingo pruning k=0.5/0.7/0.9 + importance CV analysis。依赖baseline完成。\n  expected_results:\n    status: not_attempted\n    blocked_by: baseline not completed\n  result_rationale: 'Baseline未完成，pruning sweep无法开始。即使在parallel universe中baseline 完成且SR>40%，Perceiver\n    Resampler的pruning behavior prediction是uncertain—— Perceiver使用learned query tokens\n    cross-attend to vision features， 理论上介于linear projection和pixel-shuffle之间。CV预测值可能在0.1-0.2范围。\n    但这些是speculation，无法在deadline前验证。\n\n    '\n  tables: []\n  figures_description: []\n  analysis: 无法在deadline前完成，全部列入future work。\n","numLines":515,"startLine":1,"totalLines":515}}}
