{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_018xYMhQb3vN1ZpJu4VDaofb","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"result\":\"# 项目 importance_margin_vla_compress 概况\\n\\n## 实验状态 (180 个)\\n\\n- **mvp_imm_v8b_twostage**: DONE (success) — \\n- **mvp_imm_anchor_v8_1**: DONE (negative) — \\n- **imm_two_stage_v9**: PREPARING (killed) — \\n- **mvp_imm_anchor_v8**: DONE (negative) — \\n- **mvp_baseline_v5**: DONE (success) — \\n- **mvp_imm_anchor_v7_1**: DONE (failed) — \\n- **mvp_imm_anchor_v6**: DONE (failed) — \\n- **mvp_imm_anchor_v5**: DONE (failed) — \\n- **mvp_baseline_v4**: DONE (killed) — \\n- **mvp_imm_anchor_v4**: DONE (failed) — \\n- **mvp_baseline_v3**: DONE (failed) — \\n- **mvp_imm_anchor_v2**: DONE (failed) — \\n- **mvp_baseline_v2**: DONE (failed) — \\n- **mvp_imm_anchor**: DONE (failed) — \\n- **mvp_baseline**: DONE (failed) — \\n\\n## 最新报告\\n# Handover — 2026-05-20\\n\\n> 由 Agent 生成，每次状态变更后自动更新。硬限 150 行。\\n\\n## 运行中\\n| exp_id | 假设 | 状态 | 关键指标 | W&B |\\n|--------|------|------|---------|-----|\\n| eval_xvla_prune_k02_seed44 | X-VLA L2 norm pruning at k=0.2 with seed=44 (3rd seed). Seed42 k=0.2=5.2%, seed43 k=0.2 running. If seed44 ≈ 5%, confirms near-total collapse at 80% token removal across 3 seeds. | — | — | — |\\n| eval_xvla_prune_k02_seed43 | X-VLA L2 norm pruning at k=0.2 with seed=43. Seed42 k=0.2=5.2%. Extends seed43 curve to extreme compression. If seed43 ≈ 5%, confirms near-total collapse at 80% token removal is consistent. | — | — | — |\\n| eval_xvla_prune_k03_seed44 | X-VLA L2 norm pruning at k=0.3 with seed=44 (3rd seed). Seed42=23.0%. Third seed for extreme compression point, completes 3-seed coverage for all k values. | — | — | — |\\n\\n## 待处理\\n- eval_xvla_prune_k05_seed44: X-VLA L2 norm pruning at k=0.5 with seed=44 (3rd seed). Seed42=42.6%, seed43=44.2%. If seed44 also ~43%, confirms steep degradation below cliff onset is consistent across seeds.（准备中）\\n- eval_openvla_prune_seed43_sweep: OpenVLA-OFT random pruning seed=43 sweep (k=0.7, k=0.5) to verify reproducibility of seed=7 results. If seed43 results match seed=7 (k=0.7→49%, k=0.5→37.4%), confirms graded degradation pattern is robust across seeds.（准备中）\\n- eval_openvla_prune_l2norm_sweep: OpenVLA L2 norm pruning eval (k=0.7/0.5/0.3) on LIBERO-Object. Unifies pruning method with X-VLA (both use L2 norm-based token selection). L2NormPruningHook: after projector output, sort vision tokens by L2 norm, keep top-k highest norm tokens (true removal, spatial order preserved). If L2 norm curve differs significantly from random removal curve (k=0.7: 49%, k=0.5: 37.4%, k=0.3: 20.6%), demonstrates importance-aware pruning matters for MLP projector.（准备中）\\n- analysis_smolvla_importance_cv: SmolVLA (pixel-shuffle connector) token importance CV analysis. D103 verification: if SmolVLA CV is low like π0 (0.038), entropy+CV cannot distinguish compressible/non-compressible; if high, CV is a useful predictor of connector behavior.（准备中）\\n- analysis_pi0_token_importance: π0 (3.3B, 256 tokens, linear projection) token importance analysis. Same token count as OpenVLA (256) but different connector (linear vs 3-layer MLP). If π0 pruning curve is flat like X-VLA (64 tokens, linear), confirms connector type — not token count — determines compressibility.（准备中）\\n- train_openvla_sc_m64_seed42: OpenVLA VTC-only M=64 (256→64 tokens, 75% compression). M-sweep data point between M=96 and M=32. If M=64 SR > M=32 SR, confirms monotonic degradation for MLP-projector VTC re-encoding at higher compression ratios on OpenVLA. Retry of vtconly variant after D096 approved early M-sweep start.（准备中）\\n- train_openvla_sc_m96_seed42: OpenVLA VTC-only M=96 (256→96 tokens, 62.5% compression). M-sweep data point between M=128 and M=64. If M=96 SR falls between M=128 and M=64 SR, confirms graded degradation pattern for MLP-projector VTC re-encoding on OpenVLA. Retry of vtconly variant after D096 \"}"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01BZJ5EkD2B6wW3wBsv37oJu","session_id":"b1a5