{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_0161usa3RGCSmi7EEty1JKk6","type":"tool_result","content":"397\tSmart Compress at $M = 128$ (60.0\\% $\\pm$ 0.3 over 2 seeds) achieves performance comparable to the official SmolVLA checkpoint trained with 16$\\times$ larger batch size (59.2\\%, CI [54.8\\%, 63.4\\%]). The overlapping confidence intervals preclude strong conclusions about the equivalence of these mechanisms. This comparison should be interpreted cautiously given the different training conditions (batch size, total compute, optimizer state)."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01BZJ5EkD2B6wW3wBsv37oJu","session_id":"b1a54116-c461-4e8a-8039-725147cd9263","uuid":"fa5b8391-cf2f-4710-8b36-32e57793747f","timestamp":"2026-05-20T16:55:13.554Z"}
