{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_015kf4FmoHo213C6KFkyqWA6","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"result\":\"{\\\"success\\\": true, \\\"data\\\": {\\\"path\\\": \\\"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-be-idea-gen-0515-2/projects/importance_margin_vla_compress/ROADMAP.md\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"# importance_margin_vla_compress — Research Dashboard\\\\n\\\\n> 最后更新: 2026-05-20 13:14 UTC | 更新原因: OFT confirmed bug, expanded D108 to 5-point sweep, updated GPU allocation plan\\\\n\\\\n## 核心方向\\\\nVLA vision token compressibility 的架构依赖性分析 + Diagnose-then-Compress 框架。详见 paper_framing.md。\\\\n\\\\n## 当前阶段\\\\n🔬 Research + 📝 审稿进行中 + ✍️ Paper: **8 页 main body 达标**\\\\n\\\\n## 当前进展\\\\n- **论文**: 8 页 main body + 2 refs + 8 appendix = 18 总页。全文一致性检查 0 critical。π0 entropy 已统一为 0.959。4 张 figure 全部更新。\\\\n- **实验覆盖**: C1-C4 core claims 完成。C4-ext (OpenVLA VTR) 负结果已 reframe。D108 (L2 norm 统一) 扩展到 5 点 sweep。\\\\n- **OFT pruning**: ❌ 确认 eval 脚本 bug（k=1.0=0% SR）。全部 pruning 数据无效。Paper 只保留 entropy 对比。已停止所有 OFT eval。\\\\n- **D108 初步**: L2 norm k=0.7 Task 1 = 42%（vs random 49%），L2 ≈ random 支持架构决定论\\\\n- **X-VLA seed43**: k=0.9=97.6%（一致），k=0.7 进行中 ~68.3%（vs seed42=56.2%，variance ~12pp）\\\\n\\\\n## 运行中实验\\\\n\\\\n| 实验 | 服务器:GPU | 预估完成 |\\\\n|------|-----------|---------|\\\\n| D108 L2 norm k=0.7 | westd-27271:1 | ~15:50 UTC |\\\\n| D108 L2 norm k=0.5 | westd-38929:0 | ~16:55 UTC |\\\\n| D108 L2 norm k=0.3 | westd-38929:1 | ~16:55 UTC |\\\\n| VTC-only M=96 training | westd-41074:2 | ongoing |\\\\n| VTC-only M=64 training | westd-41074:3 | ongoing |\\\\n| VTC-only M=32 training | westd-27271:1 | ongoing (shared) |\\\\n| OpenVLA seed43 random sweep | westd-27271:0 | ongoing |\\\\n| X-VLA seed43 k=0.7 | cqa1:2 | ~14:30 UTC |\\\\n| X-VLA seed43 k=0.5 | cqa1:0 | ~16:00 UTC |\\\\n\\\\n## 待分配 GPU（高优先）\\\\n\\\\n| GPU | 计划任务 |\\\\n|-----|---------|\\\\n| westd-38929:2 | D108 L2 norm k=0.9 |\\\\n| westd-38929:3 | D108 L2 norm k=0.95 |\\\\n| westd-41074:0 | OpenVLA seed43 random k=0.7（OFT 已停） |\\\\n| westd-41074:1 | OpenVLA seed43 random k=0.5（OFT 已停） |\\\\n| cqa1:1 | 待 X-VLA seed43 k=0.9 完成后分配 |\\\\n| cqa1:3 | 待确认状态 |\\\\n\\\\n## 近期任务\\\\n- [ ] Agent: kill OFT + cqa1 检查（进行中）\\\\n- [ ] Agent: 启动 D108 k=0.9/0.95 on westd-38929:2-3\\\\n- [ ] Agent: 启动 OpenVLA seed43 random k=0.7/0.5 on westd-41074:0-1\\\\n- [ ] D108 全 5 点结果 → 更新论文 Table/Figure（预计今天 17:00 UTC）\\\\n- [ ] X-VLA seed43 完成 → 报 mean±std（k=0.7 variance ~12pp）\\\\n- [ ] OpenVLA seed43 完成 → 补 multi-seed CIs\\\\n- [ ] Paper Agent: 根据 D108 结果更新 experimental_setup.tex 和 results.tex\\\\n\\\\n## GPU 预算\\\\n4 台服务器共 14 GPU：\\\\n- westd-27271: 2 GPU (2/2 在用)\\\\n- westd-38929: 4 GPU (2/4 在用, **2 空闲待分配**)\\\\n- westd-41074: 4 GPU (2/4 在用, **2 待释放 OFT 后分配**)\\\\n- cqa1-33015: 4 GPU (2/4 在用, **2 待确认/分配**)\\\\n\\\\n## Deadlines\\\\n- **CoRL 2026 Abstract**: May 26 (6 days)\\\\n- **CoRL 2026 Paper**: May 29 (9 days)\\\\n\\\\n## 关键决策日志\\\\n\\\\n| ID | 日期 | 摘要 | 关联实验 |\\\\n|----|------|------|----------|\\\\n| D112 | 2026-05-20 | C4-ext M=128 abandoned. VTC-only M=32/M=64 continu | train_openvla_sc_m128_seed42, train_openvla_sc_m32_vtconly_seed42, train_openvla_sc_m64_seed42_v3 |\\\\n| D111 | 2026-05-20 | X-VLA Batch 2 complete: full 8-point curve confirm | eval_xvla_prune_batch2 |\\\\n| D110 | 2026-05-20 | D109: C4-ext VTR on OpenVLA M=128 confirmed 0% SR  | train_openvla_sc_m128_seed42 |\\\\n| D109 | 2026-05-20 | C4-ext 20K eval confirmed 0% SR — VTR on OpenVLA ( | train_openvla_sc_m128_vtconly_seed42, eval_openvla_sc_m128_vtconly_20k_seed42 |\\\\n| D108 | 2026-05-20 | D108: Pruning method discrepancy confirmed — OpenV | eval_openvla_crossmodel_pruning, eval_xvla_pruning_libero |\\\\n| D107 | 2026-05-20 | D106 RESOLVED: X-VLA cliff pattern (97.6%→56.2% at | eval_xvla_pruning_libero, analysis_pi0_token_importance, analysis_xvla_token_importance |\\\\n| D106 | 2026-05-20 | X-VLA k=0.7 出现 task-specific 崩塌（~50% SR），暂不修改 C3a  | eval_xvla_pruning_libero, analysis_pi0_token_importance |\\\\n| D105 |